From: kevinbrar2024 <kevinbrar2024@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:34:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep a dig's routed remainder in the library until its move
 happens (CR 616.1, CR 701.44a)

A DigChoice that keeps cards on top of the library lifted every looked-at
card out of the library's list before routing the remainder. When the
remainder goes to another zone and that move waits on a choice between
replacement effects, the card was a library object in no zone list. Only a
remainder routed back into the library is lifted now; the zone pipeline
removes the others when they move.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
